  "position": 10,
  "group": "Management",
  "description": "The organisation as a tree of spaces: the company, its departments and teams, and the roles people hold in them (Lead engineer, Buyer, ...). A role's work and pages stay with it when someone else takes it over; each role someone holds is a tab on their Home.",
  "tables": [
